{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/3def5b7bd1f51aa02283d2ca1c467948.poster.avif?t=1634603683\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/3def5b7bd1f51aa02283d2ca1c467948.webm?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/3def5b7bd1f51aa02283d2ca1c467948.mp4?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Inspired by blazingly fast arcade racers and punishing platformers, you will crash fast, you will crash hard, and you will crash often. You'll be instantly thrown back into the action to apply what you've learned. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/eb3529016b49495c5ca81ed0180f733a.poster.avif?t=1634603683\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/eb3529016b49495c5ca81ed0180f733a.webm?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/eb3529016b49495c5ca81ed0180f733a.mp4?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You'll be crashing across 100+ levels divided into 10+ worlds, each world introducing it's own unique hazards and challenges. Daily, weekly and monthly playlists keeps the challenge fresh as you compete for the top spot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/338280371d4a1bb59173dda9ea0ffd47.poster.avif?t=1634603683\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/338280371d4a1bb59173dda9ea0ffd47.webm?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/338280371d4a1bb59173dda9ea0ffd47.mp4?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Save the 'Verse from THE CORRUPTION, a program gone rouge. It's only purpose is now the complete and total deletion of the 'Verse and all backup data. You'll discover the origin of the 'Verse, how the CORRUPTION came to be, and why it's hellbent on the complete and total destruction of not only itself but all of the 'Verse.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/c176adf434f693e027df8969a86bdb02.poster.avif?t=1634603683\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/c176adf434f693e027df8969a86bdb02.webm?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/extras/c176adf434f693e027df8969a86bdb02.mp4?t=1634603683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1525530?t=1634603683","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1634603683","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1634603683","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1634603683","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"ful